---
// BentoFeatures.astro
---

<section id="features" class="features-section">
  <div class="container-max">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <div class="badge badge-amber">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect></svg>
        <span data-i18n="feat.badge">核心特性</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="feat.title">为重度阅读者打造的轻量利器</h2>
      <p class="section-desc" data-i18n="feat.desc">
        拒绝臃肿与繁琐，每一个交互细节都精雕细琢。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 11-6 6v3h3l6-6"/><path d="m22 2-2 2-4-4 2-2a2.828 2.828 0 1 1 4 4z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title" data-i18n="feat.f1Title">智能浮动工具栏</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc" data-i18n="feat.f1Desc">
          鼠标选中文本即刻弹出，提供高亮、复制、链接直达三种高频操作，手感轻巧。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title" data-i18n="feat.f2Title">丰富调色盘与自定义 HEX</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc" data-i18n="feat.f2Desc">
          荧光黄、薄荷绿、天空蓝、香芋紫、活力橙等柔和护眼色彩，支持输入任意自定义色值。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title" data-i18n="feat.f3Title">原生 Text Fragment 链接</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc" data-i18n="feat.f3Desc">
          生成遵循 W3C 国际标准的文本片段 URL，对方无需安装插件，任何现代浏览器均可直达。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4 -->
      <div class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="9" y1="3" x2="9" y2="21"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title" data-i18n="feat.f4Title">聚焦式侧边栏管理器</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc" data-i18n="feat.f4Desc">
          随浏览器侧边栏常驻，按页面聚合高亮，支持多选导出、序号切换与色彩批处理。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5 -->
      <div class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title" data-i18n="feat.f5Title">100% 纯本地与隐私保护</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc" data-i18n="feat.f5Desc">
          数据完全存储于本地 chrome.storage，无第三方追踪、无云端同步泄露风险。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6 -->
      <div class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title" data-i18n="feat.f6Title">快捷操作与批量导出</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc" data-i18n="feat.f6Desc">
          支持一键勾选多段高亮复制为整理笔记，支持右下角快捷悬浮按钮随心开关。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features-section {
    padding: 5.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .feat-card {
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--bg-page);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .feat-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .feat-icon-box {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: #f59e0b;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .feat-title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .feat-desc {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
</style>
